    <h1>Data Journalism Attendance, Fall 2026</h1>

    <p>This chart shows how attendance in Data Journalism varied during the
    fall 2026 semester at Binghamton University. The course meets Mondays and
    Wednesdays from 8:00 to 9:30 a.m. It began on August 18, but that first
    session is not included here. Attendance is recorded within the first ten
    minutes of class, so students who arrive after that are counted absent.
    All 19 enrolled students have never been present at the same session.
    Attendance in October ran lower than in September, and Wednesdays appear
    to run lower than Mondays.</p>

